    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good high-level summary. I'm trying to get more into the actual logic for my paper, though. Could you go a bit deeper on the conservative side? I want to make sure I'm not just treating it as \"because the Bible says so\"—is there a more sophisticated philosophical or theological framework they use to argue against it, or is it mostly just based on scriptural interpretation?",
